An --append argument carrying no `=` is a user error, rejected before the file is touched.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md --append nope
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: malformed key=value pair: 'nope'
